.TH LIVEPLOT 2
.SH NAME
liveplot \- drawing primitives for live simulation displays
.SH SYNOPSIS
.EX
include "liveplot.m";
liveplot := load Liveplot Liveplot->PATH;
liveplot->grid(image, rectangle, colour, 10, 10);
liveplot->series(image, rectangle, x, y, n,
        xmin, xmax, ymin, ymax, colour);
.EE
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Liveplot
provides model-independent drawing operations for continuously updated
simulations.  It maps real coordinates to image coordinates, draws grids,
renders time series and phase paths, and draws parameter sliders.
.PP
It deliberately does not own a window, event loop, history policy, equations,
labels, or domain visualization.  Applications can combine its plots with
spatial or symbolic views such as an orbit, court, compartment flow, or stock.
.SH SOURCE
.B /module/liveplot.m
.br
.B /appl/lib/liveplot.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR draw (2),
.IR numerics (2)
